1
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:08,940
=When the Lights Rise=
=Episode 7=

2
00:01:17,220 --> 00:01:18,060
Don't move.

3
00:01:24,820 --> 00:01:26,660
I'm wearing a hairpin.

4
00:01:26,900 --> 00:01:27,820
A hairpin?

5
00:01:28,140 --> 00:01:29,060
There's a blade inside.

6
00:01:33,100 --> 00:01:33,980
A little higher.

7
00:01:51,980 --> 00:01:53,380
We didn't report this to the boss.

8
00:01:53,380 --> 00:01:55,100
Will we get in trouble for doing this?

9
00:01:55,220 --> 00:01:56,460
He'll understand.

10
00:01:56,820 --> 00:01:59,260
I'm doing this for his own good.

11
00:02:32,300 --> 00:02:33,100
Lisa.

12
00:02:38,940 --> 00:02:40,180
Who sent you to kill us?

13
00:02:40,740 --> 00:02:41,540
No one.

14
00:02:41,660 --> 00:02:43,620
Then why do you keep trying to kill me?

15
00:02:44,220 --> 00:02:45,100
I don't want to.

16
00:02:45,940 --> 00:02:47,220
But I have no choice.

17
00:02:47,340 --> 00:02:48,100
As long as you're alive,

18
00:02:48,100 --> 00:02:49,940
sooner or later,
my reputation will be ruined.

19
00:02:49,940 --> 00:02:51,220
You'll drive me to my death.

20
00:02:51,310 --> 00:02:52,460
Your life and reputation ruined?

21
00:02:54,540 --> 00:02:55,340
Lisa.

22
00:02:55,340 --> 00:02:56,580
(Lisa, Kong Shun)

23
00:02:56,580 --> 00:02:57,380
Kong Shun.

24
00:02:57,620 --> 00:02:59,100
Director Kong
of the Civil Affairs Bureau.

25
00:02:59,260 --> 00:02:59,980
Are you saying

26
00:03:00,620 --> 00:03:01,820
that Black Cat list...

27
00:03:02,020 --> 00:03:02,820
Who wrote it?

28
00:03:02,820 --> 00:03:03,860
What's it used for?

29
00:03:04,300 --> 00:03:05,180
I never expected

30
00:03:05,860 --> 00:03:07,540
the list really was in your possession.

31
00:03:07,540 --> 00:03:09,700
Lisa, please tell me, okay?

32
00:03:11,060 --> 00:03:11,940
We were friends, after all.

33
00:03:12,060 --> 00:03:13,260
I won't tell anyone.

34
00:03:13,300 --> 00:03:14,860
This is very important to me.

35
00:03:17,260 --> 00:03:18,420
It doesn't matter anymore.

36
00:03:19,820 --> 00:03:20,940
None of it matters anymore.

37
00:03:20,940 --> 00:03:22,100
It really matters.

38
00:03:22,540 --> 00:03:23,660
Trust me, Lisa.

39
00:03:23,660 --> 00:03:25,540
Yan Qing and I

40
00:03:25,540 --> 00:03:26,780
will both help you.

41
00:03:27,620 --> 00:03:28,500
You can't.

42
00:03:32,220 --> 00:03:33,300
Your very existence

43
00:03:33,820 --> 00:03:36,140
will constantly remind me
of what I've been through

44
00:03:36,540 --> 00:03:38,620
and make me suffer endlessly.

45
00:03:39,940 --> 00:03:40,740
Lisa.

46
00:03:40,860 --> 00:03:41,940
As for Mei Xiaozhu,

47
00:03:44,020 --> 00:03:46,060
the one who sent her into that nightmare

48
00:03:47,740 --> 00:03:48,540
was me.

49
00:03:51,220 --> 00:03:52,100
The coca wine

50
00:03:52,740 --> 00:03:54,620
was something I tricked
her into drinking.

51
00:03:55,260 --> 00:03:56,940
Those are the rules of the register.

52
00:03:57,250 --> 00:04:00,060
When someone new joins,
someone else leaves.

53
00:04:01,500 --> 00:04:02,980
I had you both tied up tonight

54
00:04:03,700 --> 00:04:05,460
as one last gamble with my life.

55
00:04:06,540 --> 00:04:08,060
If you died,

56
00:04:08,540 --> 00:04:10,460
I could finally put
everything behind me.

57
00:04:11,220 --> 00:04:12,500
If you survived,

58
00:04:13,220 --> 00:04:14,780
I'd accept my fate.

59
00:04:35,420 --> 00:04:36,220
- Lisa!
- Lisa!

60
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:39,360
- Lisa!
- Lisa!

61
00:04:50,660 --> 00:04:51,460
Yuhe.

62
00:04:52,140 --> 00:04:52,940
Yuhe.

63
00:04:56,340 --> 00:04:58,020
You're finally back.

64
00:04:58,020 --> 00:04:59,300
Where have you been all day?

65
00:04:59,620 --> 00:05:00,820
The shop's been empty all day.

66
00:05:00,820 --> 00:05:02,340
How can you run a business like this?

67
00:05:02,340 --> 00:05:03,340
What are you doing here?

68
00:05:03,810 --> 00:05:04,740
What am I doing here?

69
00:05:04,740 --> 00:05:06,260
I'm delivering something.

70
00:05:06,340 --> 00:05:08,700
Wait, what happened to you?

71
00:05:08,970 --> 00:05:09,420
You...

72
00:05:09,420 --> 00:05:10,900
How did you end up like this?

73
00:05:10,900 --> 00:05:11,620
Yan Qing.

74
00:05:11,740 --> 00:05:12,580
And who is this?

75
00:05:13,860 --> 00:05:14,700
He's my friend.

76
00:05:18,620 --> 00:05:19,420
And this is...

77
00:05:20,090 --> 00:05:21,620
I'm Yan Qing, a reporter destined

78
00:05:21,620 --> 00:05:23,660
to make a name for myself in Shanghai.

79
00:05:23,660 --> 00:05:25,900
And I'm Mei Yuhe's only
good friend in Shanghai.

80
00:05:26,060 --> 00:05:26,860
What about you?

81
00:05:28,020 --> 00:05:28,820
Ding Zhao.

82
00:05:28,980 --> 00:05:29,380
Hey.

83
00:05:30,730 --> 00:05:31,300
What's with him?

84
00:05:32,020 --> 00:05:32,820
Yan Qing.

85
00:05:53,620 --> 00:05:54,580
It's her?

86
00:06:12,820 --> 00:06:13,540
Lisa.

87
00:06:15,860 --> 00:06:16,700
Lisa.

88
00:06:18,900 --> 00:06:19,780
Lisa.

89
00:06:21,580 --> 00:06:22,340
Lisa.

90
00:06:44,140 --> 00:06:45,220
Who killed her?

91
00:06:48,620 --> 00:06:51,790
I did. I wounded her.

92
00:06:53,100 --> 00:06:56,220
You could say I caused her death.

93
00:06:58,620 --> 00:06:59,500
Why?

94
00:07:00,740 --> 00:07:01,660
Why?

95
00:07:04,460 --> 00:07:06,220
She tried to kill Miss Mei first.

96
00:07:06,220 --> 00:07:07,340
And she was also...

97
00:07:14,660 --> 00:07:16,060
Responsible for Xiaozhu's death.

98
00:07:26,340 --> 00:07:27,140
Never mind.

99
00:07:42,260 --> 00:07:43,780
If she were still alive,

100
00:07:45,700 --> 00:07:46,940
I could at least ask her some questions.

101
00:07:49,460 --> 00:07:50,660
But now,

102
00:07:52,900 --> 00:07:55,060
she surely wouldn't want me
to learn any more.

103
00:08:23,540 --> 00:08:24,820
You should go home.

104
00:08:25,700 --> 00:08:26,700
Whatever it is,

105
00:08:27,460 --> 00:08:28,580
we'll talk tomorrow.

106
00:08:40,550 --> 00:08:41,200
Thank you.

107
00:10:56,660 --> 00:10:59,380
(One puff. Just one puff. Just one.)

108
00:10:59,500 --> 00:11:01,460
Zhao, don't tie Mother up.

109
00:11:01,460 --> 00:11:04,020
- I want Mother!
- Just one puff.

110
00:11:04,020 --> 00:11:05,420
Don't tie her up.

111
00:11:05,420 --> 00:11:06,860
She's not our mother anymore!

112
00:11:06,860 --> 00:11:08,380
Zhao, you're mean.

113
00:11:08,420 --> 00:11:10,180
You're not my brother.

114
00:11:32,300 --> 00:11:34,020
Did you get together with Lv Mengde

115
00:11:35,620 --> 00:11:37,460
just to spite me?

116
00:11:49,820 --> 00:11:50,620
Uncle.

117
00:11:52,740 --> 00:11:53,740
Look at you.

118
00:11:54,420 --> 00:11:56,260
You've gotten yourself
into such a state,

119
00:11:56,460 --> 00:11:57,940
and you've let Yiyi run away.

120
00:11:58,340 --> 00:12:00,260
What have you been doing?

121
00:12:00,820 --> 00:12:02,220
I just don't understand.

122
00:12:02,740 --> 00:12:04,820
Why did you have to get involved?

123
00:12:05,220 --> 00:12:06,660
Why insist on provoking Lv Mengde?

124
00:12:07,420 --> 00:12:09,580
How are we supposed
to live in Shanghai now?

125
00:12:11,820 --> 00:12:13,460
He's the one who approached Yiyi first.

126
00:12:13,620 --> 00:12:17,300
Love doesn't follow reason.

127
00:12:20,620 --> 00:12:21,540
If you ask me,

128
00:12:21,760 --> 00:12:23,220
you should just apologize

129
00:12:23,570 --> 00:12:25,140
and work hard for Boss Lv.

130
00:12:25,820 --> 00:12:27,980
Whether Yiyi becomes his concubine

131
00:12:28,140 --> 00:12:29,420
or his mistress...

132
00:12:29,420 --> 00:12:30,140
Uncle.

133
00:12:30,660 --> 00:12:32,180
How can you say that?

134
00:12:35,060 --> 00:12:38,420
Miss Mei has nothing to lose.

135
00:12:38,420 --> 00:12:39,780
Why get involved with her?

136
00:12:40,020 --> 00:12:41,900
If you hadn't followed her around
investigating every day,

137
00:12:42,220 --> 00:12:44,580
would things have gotten
this bad between you and Yiyi?

138
00:12:44,620 --> 00:12:46,020
If I hadn't kept investigating,

139
00:12:46,500 --> 00:12:47,380
Yiyi

140
00:12:47,900 --> 00:12:49,740
would have become another Mei Xiaozhu.

141
00:12:54,340 --> 00:12:55,420
You just got back.

142
00:12:55,420 --> 00:12:56,380
Where are you going now?

143
00:12:57,220 --> 00:12:58,180
I'm going to find Yiyi.

144
00:12:58,460 --> 00:12:59,260
If I don't look for her,

145
00:12:59,300 --> 00:13:00,420
how will she ever come home?

146
00:13:47,140 --> 00:13:49,340
I never got the chance to give you this.

147
00:13:50,620 --> 00:13:53,460
Keep it if you like it.

148
00:13:54,900 --> 00:13:56,180
If you don't,

149
00:13:57,540 --> 00:13:59,420
just throw it away when you cross
the Bridge of Forgetfulness.

150
00:14:59,470 --> 00:15:00,690
Last night's shipment.

151
00:15:00,940 --> 00:15:02,020
Was it arranged by the boss?

152
00:15:03,170 --> 00:15:03,980
What's he planning?

153
00:15:07,020 --> 00:15:10,100
Just helping a client move some goods.

154
00:15:10,900 --> 00:15:11,780
A client?

155
00:15:12,420 --> 00:15:13,140
Who?

156
00:15:13,140 --> 00:15:14,940
Now you're concerned
about the boss's business too?

157
00:15:14,940 --> 00:15:16,060
Since it involves the Kuang family,

158
00:15:16,060 --> 00:15:17,500
shouldn't I be concerned?

159
00:15:19,420 --> 00:15:21,700
Right now, you should be
more concerned about Lisa.

160
00:15:23,820 --> 00:15:24,860
What about her now?

161
00:15:26,460 --> 00:15:27,660
She went to collect the goods last night

162
00:15:27,940 --> 00:15:29,700
and ran into Ding Zhao and Mei Yuhe.

163
00:15:30,220 --> 00:15:31,020
And then?

164
00:15:32,020 --> 00:15:32,940
She tried to silence them,

165
00:15:33,300 --> 00:15:34,460
but failed.

166
00:15:35,420 --> 00:15:36,900
You should've made sure they were dead.

167
00:15:37,700 --> 00:15:38,500
Or

168
00:15:38,940 --> 00:15:41,220
you could've chosen
not to do something so foolish.

169
00:15:42,620 --> 00:15:45,860
I was only trying
to help you solve your problems.

170
00:15:47,620 --> 00:15:49,700
Isn't it better now that she's dead?

171
00:15:49,700 --> 00:15:51,740
Don't think I don't know
what you're trying to do.

172
00:15:55,140 --> 00:15:56,460
Killing the Mei sisters

173
00:15:57,420 --> 00:15:59,420
won't free you from your nightmares.

174
00:16:02,720 --> 00:16:03,740
Fool.

175
00:16:04,590 --> 00:16:06,900
If you hadn't announced in the newspaper
that she was getting married

176
00:16:07,320 --> 00:16:08,460
and crushed her dream
of becoming a singer,

177
00:16:09,780 --> 00:16:11,540
she wouldn't have done
such foolish things.

178
00:16:13,260 --> 00:16:13,980
Where is she?

179
00:16:14,340 --> 00:16:15,140
Dead.

180
00:16:16,420 --> 00:16:18,180
Why was she in such a hurry?

181
00:16:19,380 --> 00:16:22,020
She thought I couldn't handle Mei Yuhe

182
00:16:22,020 --> 00:16:23,160
and would ruin her dream
of becoming a singer,

183
00:16:24,740 --> 00:16:26,180
so she rushed off to get herself killed.

184
00:16:27,380 --> 00:16:28,580
You chose her yourself,

185
00:16:29,380 --> 00:16:30,380
but you failed to keep
her under control.

186
00:16:31,340 --> 00:16:33,100
If she'd managed to force
that woman into the open,

187
00:16:33,110 --> 00:16:34,080
it might have been worthwhile.

188
00:16:35,250 --> 00:16:36,700
But before she could be of any real use,

189
00:16:36,860 --> 00:16:37,900
she died.

190
00:16:38,620 --> 00:16:39,700
All that money wasted.

191
00:16:40,860 --> 00:16:41,500
What a shame.

192
00:16:42,820 --> 00:16:44,540
So all you care about is the money?

193
00:16:46,080 --> 00:16:47,220
That's not fair.

194
00:16:48,300 --> 00:16:49,620
I care about you too.

195
00:16:53,020 --> 00:16:54,500
If I died one day,

196
00:16:55,420 --> 00:16:57,060
would you come collect my body?

197
00:16:59,900 --> 00:17:01,020
People like us

198
00:17:01,820 --> 00:17:03,900
are destined to die without
even a body left intact.

199
00:17:04,700 --> 00:17:05,840
What would there be to collect?

200
00:17:10,260 --> 00:17:11,860
So that's how we'll end up.

201
00:17:37,920 --> 00:17:42,520
(The invitation Mei Xiaozhu used to enter
the Paris Hotel was his. Lv Mengde.)

202
00:17:47,300 --> 00:17:48,900
(I was the one who liked Mengde first.)

203
00:17:48,900 --> 00:17:50,260
(What right did she have
to steal him from me?)

204
00:17:50,300 --> 00:17:52,620
(She even cut her hair short,
just the way he liked it!)

205
00:17:52,700 --> 00:17:53,340
Yuhe.

206
00:17:53,340 --> 00:17:54,780
Could you cut my hair?

207
00:18:09,100 --> 00:18:10,180
(Xiaozhu.)

208
00:18:10,940 --> 00:18:11,940
(Don't worry.)

209
00:18:12,780 --> 00:18:14,060
(Once the sun rises,)

210
00:18:14,540 --> 00:18:16,740
(I'll make sure you get justice.)

211
00:18:17,900 --> 00:18:18,700
(Soon,)

212
00:18:19,780 --> 00:18:21,420
(you'll finally be able
to rest in peace.)

213
00:18:22,560 --> 00:18:25,600
♪And watch the lights
come on one by one♪

214
00:18:26,160 --> 00:18:29,000
♪Like blades cutting
through the radiance♪

215
00:18:29,640 --> 00:18:32,480
♪You may treat me as dust
beneath your feet♪

216
00:18:32,480 --> 00:18:34,400
♪Or wipe me away like ashes♪

217
00:18:34,400 --> 00:18:35,960
♪Leaving a cold ending♪

218
00:18:35,960 --> 00:18:37,920
♪But I refuse to fall♪

219
00:18:37,920 --> 00:18:42,840
♪I refuse to become a shadow
fading beneath the lights♪

220
00:18:42,960 --> 00:18:45,400
♪I refuse to dissolve into♪

221
00:18:46,480 --> 00:18:49,480
♪The lifeless light of the past♪

222
00:18:49,800 --> 00:18:52,640
♪I want sharpness at my fingertips♪

223
00:18:52,680 --> 00:18:55,480
♪And steps that avoid
the traps among the thorns♪

224
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:59,080
♪At dawn, I will look
straight into your eyes♪

225
00:18:59,080 --> 00:19:02,280
♪My gaze clear, illuminating the dawn♪

226
00:19:03,760 --> 00:19:06,520
♪Those who have hurt me♪

227
00:19:07,080 --> 00:19:09,760
♪I choose to pierce through♪

228
00:19:11,360 --> 00:19:12,840
♪To tear apart♪

229
00:19:12,960 --> 00:19:18,840
♪To ignite a sacred flame♪

230
00:19:20,520 --> 00:19:22,640
♪I do not pray to the gods♪

231
00:19:22,640 --> 00:19:25,560
♪Nor bow to power♪

232
00:19:25,560 --> 00:19:27,840
♪I will no longer play the tragic lead♪

233
00:19:29,640 --> 00:19:33,560
♪I will stand and carve
the path of my own fate♪
